1
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:05,160
那没有常性的月亮，
"Oh swear not by by the moon,

2
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,400
三十天里它竟会
the inconstant moon,

3
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:10,600
变上几回圆缺。
that monthly changes in her circled orb,

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:14,340
免得你的爱就象月亮一样变化无常。
lest that thy love prove likewise,variable."

5
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,420
那该拿什么起誓呢？
"What shall I swear by?"

6
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:20,900
Hey!

7
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,680
现在是在朗读罗密欧与朱莉叶懂吗？
We're trying to do a little "Romeo and Juliet" here!

8
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,320
不需要感觉迟钝的蠢货来煞风景！
We don't need no insensitive jerk,messing it up.

9
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:28,410
对不起教练。
I'm sorry Coach.

10
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:32,840
算了。你继续念罗密欧发誓的那一段。
Alright...err...go back to the part where Romeo was thwearing.

11
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:37,440
好了，同学们，
Ok,people.

12
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,520
记得下星期要考
Remember next week we have a major exam

13
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,900
莎士比亚的十四行诗，
on all the Shakespeare Sonnets.

14
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,220
一定要把节奏和韵律念出来。
So you better know your assonants from your elbows.

15
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:47,580
走吧，Carol，你怎么了？
Are you coming Carol,or what?

16
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:52,600
如今哪有像罗密欧这么重感情的人？
Where are sensitive men,like Romeo,nowadays?

17
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:55,180
那么能哭敢哭的男人。
Men,who aren't afraid to cry.

18
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:58,720
可现在有些男人听莎士比亚就会睡觉。
I mean,all we have are insensitive jocks.

19
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:01,680
你认为汤姆克鲁斯会哭吗？
Do you think Tom Cruise Cries?

20
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,960
他想干什么都能行。
Tom Cruise can do anything he wants.

21
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:09,340
Seaver!

22
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:11,700
什么事，罗布克先生？
Yes,Mr. Lovett.

23
00:01:12,390 --> 00:01:16,030
对你说一句让你震惊的话，
I'm gonna say something to you that might shock you.

24
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:18,380
这个班只有你，能和我媲美。
But in this class,I consider you my equal.

25
00:01:20,740 --> 00:01:21,940
我是说
Well,what I mean is,

26
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,200
如果我有个关于莎士比亚的问题，
if I had a question about Shakespeare,

27
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:26,980
并且能问他也能问你，
and I had a choice of either asking him or you;

28
00:01:26,980 --> 00:01:27,980
我会问你。
I'd ask you.

29
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:30,260
噢，谢谢。
Well thank you.

30
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:31,880
这和他总是穿着紧身服跑来跑去
And it has nothing to do with the fact that

31
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:33,300
并无关系。
they ran around in tights all the time.

32
00:01:33,750 --> 00:01:36,690
我是说想让你帮帮我，
And the point is,is that I need your help.

33
00:01:37,020 --> 00:01:38,180
说真的，
It's no big secret that

34
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:39,820
要不是奥布太太生病的话，
I wouldn't even be teaching this class,

35
00:01:39,820 --> 00:01:42,560
我是根本不会来教这门课的。懂我的意思吗？
if Mrs. Orbeaux hadn't gone a little bit flaky,if you know what I mean?

36
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:46,000
是这样的，班上有位同学他要不及格了，
But there's a kid who's flunking the class,

37
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,000
我感到我有责任。
who shouldn't be and I kind o' blame myself.

38
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:53,180
所以我在想，也许你能辅导他。
So,I was wondering if,maybe you could tutor him.

39
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:57,980
我觉得我这个人当不了辅导……
Well,I've never really thought of myself as a ...

40
00:01:57,980 --> 00:01:58,460
老师。
teacher.

41
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:01,500
谁说的？你同意吗？
Hey,who has? So what do you say?

42
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,480
好吧，让我试一试。
Ok,I'll give it a shot.

43
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:06,060
好，对！波比。
Ah,yeah. Hey,Bobby!

44
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,940
这个运动员？
The jock?

45
00:02:07,940 --> 00:02:08,700
来了教练。
Yo,Coach!!

46
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:11,210
听着波比，
Now,Bobby.

47
00:02:11,210 --> 00:02:14,010
Seaver她想要帮你通过莎士比亚考试。
Seaver here's gonna help you through all that Shakespeare stuff...

48
00:02:14,010 --> 00:02:14,500
好极了。
Alright.

49
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:17,700
现在你完全得听她的，
Now,look! You do everything she says,

50
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:20,000
你不通过考试就不准踢球，
because,if you don't pass,you don't play.

51
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:23,240
把眼睛哭红了也没有用
And it aint gonna do you no good comin' crying your eyes out to me;

52
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,260
就像你去年出现过的那样
like you did last year.

53
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:32,240
还没正式介绍过呢。我是波比·温尼特。
I don't thing we ever really met. I'm Bobby Winette.

54
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:33,460
我知道。
I know.

55
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,500
你是才女Carol。
And you're Carol,"The Brain".

56
00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:36,700
我知道。
I know.

57
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:42,580
你去年真的把眼哭红了。
You actually cried last year?

58
00:02:43,060 --> 00:02:43,700
是的。
Yeah.

59
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:45,860
我尿急了。
Groin pull.

60
00:02:48,110 --> 00:03:56,780
-= Subripped by Susie Shi =-       2007.07.29

61
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:57,840
谁啊？
Hello.

62
00:03:57,840 --> 00:04:00,060
我可不是你的病人，爸爸，
It's not one of your mental patients,Dad,

63
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,020
是我。
it's just me.

64
00:04:01,930 --> 00:04:03,820
回来得早啊，Ben。
Hey,you're home early,Ben.

65
00:04:03,820 --> 00:04:05,400
是的，我们老师食物中毒了
Yeah,my teacher got food poisoning

66
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,240
吃了食堂里的鱼
from the "Tuna Surprise" in the cafeteria.

67
00:04:09,450 --> 00:04:11,230
她说真是没想到。
She was surprised alright.

68
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:11,760
她没事吧？
Is she OK?

69
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:12,480
可能的，
I guess.

70
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:14,740
刚上课凯特老师还在给我们
Alls I know is that one minute Miss Cutter was reading off

71
00:04:14,740 --> 00:04:16,320
念小鱼本事大，可一下
"The Little Fish That Could",and the next minute,

72
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,680
她就倒在窗台上了。
she was rowfing out the window.

73
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:22,380
HI，爸爸，知道我们学校怎么样？
Hey,Dad! Ask me how school went today!

74
00:04:22,380 --> 00:04:23,320
准没好事。
I'm afraid to...

75
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:25,660
是好事爸爸，健康课来了个小测验，
It went great Dad we had this pop quiz in health class

76
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:28,260
我得了个，一个优！
and got ... Are you ready for this?... an A!!!

77
00:04:28,260 --> 00:04:28,960
是优？
An A?

78
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:29,640
对！
Yeah!

79
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:30,980
祝贺你啊。
Great news son.

80
00:04:30,980 --> 00:04:31,620
瞧
Yeah,Yeah. See,

81
00:04:31,620 --> 00:04:33,240
要我们列举食物的四个类别
we had to list the four basic food groups,

82
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:35,120
我每一个都写对了。
and I got every single one of 'em right.

83
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:39,920
哗！
Wow!

84
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,720
温习两小时真是没白费。
Those two hours of studying really paid off.

85
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:45,340
HI,爸爸。
Hi Dad.

86
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:45,820
Hi.

87
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,540
Mike你回来了？
Mike,you're home!!

88
00:04:48,340 --> 00:04:49,800
Ben？你也回来了？
Ben,you're home too!!

89
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:51,680
爸爸，你让Mike把Ben带走好吗？
Dad,would you make Mike take Ben some place.

90
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,340
你建议带哪去？
Any place in particular?

91
00:04:54,980 --> 00:04:56,160
最好是去北京。
Beijing would be good.

92
00:04:58,320 --> 00:04:59,580
你为什么突然要
Look! How come all of a sudden,

93
00:04:59,580 --> 00:05:00,460
撵我们走？
you don't want us around?

94
00:05:00,540 --> 00:05:01,480
不是突然。
It's not sudden.

95
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:03,730
Carol!

96
00:05:03,730 --> 00:05:03,830
Carol？

97
00:05:03,830 --> 00:05:04,600
我明白了爸爸，
Oh,no,no,no,I get it Dad.

98
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:07,880
她一定是想带回个什么有头脑的朋友，
She's probably got one of her "oh so brainy friends" coming over

99
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:10,000
怕我们会使她难堪，
and she's afraid that we'll embarrass her.

100
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,120
当然了，我们会那样的。
Which of course we will.

101
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:15,820
我带谁回来当你没有任何关系。
It's none of your business,who I've got coming over.

102
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:19,890
Carol，以你的兄弟为羞耻可不好。
Look,Carol,being ashamed of your brothers,is not nice.

103
00:05:19,890 --> 00:05:21,530
对！
Yeah.

104
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,790
有时会更糟。
Could've been worse.

105
00:05:26,820 --> 00:05:29,440
好了，谁愿意和我一块去接你们的母亲？--
Which one of you guys wants to come with me to pick up your Mom?

106
00:05:30,860 --> 00:05:31,960
请吃冰淇淋。
Free ice-cream.

107
00:05:32,180 --> 00:05:32,860
快走！
Let's roll.

108
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:38,600
我可不希望你去打扰他们
And I don't want you to be bothering your sister

109
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,800
当你妹妹的小朋友来，
when her little friend is here.

110
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:41,000
我不会的爸爸。
Hey,no sweat Dad.

111
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:51,580
Mike，你干嘛不找个地方去数数你的脑细胞？！
Mike,why don't you go some place and count your brain cell?

112
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:54,360
你怎么了？
What is it with you?

113
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:55,280
究竟是谁要来？
Who's coming over?

114
00:05:56,270 --> 00:05:58,100
至高无上的小丑皇后！
The...the geek queen of Dewey High?

115
00:05:58,100 --> 00:05:59,840
你管得也太宽了！
It's none of your business.

116
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:02,620
哦，明白了，
Oh. I get it.

117
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:04,160
不是什么小丑皇后，
This isn't just like a she-geek,

118
00:06:04,340 --> 00:06:06,000
是小丑国王。是吗？
this is a he-geek,isn't it?

119
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,760
你这个无赖！
You're scum.

120
00:06:11,420 --> 00:06:13,880
说吧，是谁？象棋俱乐部的肌肉男？
So,who is it? Like a hunk from the chess club?

121
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:18,380
还是荣誉协会的书呆子？
A total babe from the honors society?

122
00:06:22,900 --> 00:06:24,280
你就别费劲了，
For your information,

123
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:27,120
我告诉你吧，他是大学足球队的队长。
it happens to be the Captain of the varsity football team.

124
00:06:28,140 --> 00:06:29,290
波比·温尼特？
Bobby Winette?

125
00:06:29,290 --> 00:06:30,570
对！
Yeah.

126
00:06:30,570 --> 00:06:31,480
哦，等一下。
Wow...wai...wait a minute.

127
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:34,520
波比到咱们家来，来看你？！
Bobby Winette is coming over here to see you?

128
00:06:35,140 --> 00:06:35,780
是的！
Yeah.

129
00:06:37,020 --> 00:06:37,580
干嘛？
Why?

130
00:06:43,220 --> 00:06:44,100
来了，请看！
There. See?

131
00:06:45,150 --> 00:06:47,030
你好。
Err...hello.

132
00:06:47,030 --> 00:06:47,780
哟，波比！是你啊！
Yo! Bobby! My man!

133
00:06:47,780 --> 00:06:49,400
你好吗老兄？
How in the heck are you doing bro?

134
00:06:50,030 --> 00:06:52,560
很好！Mark？对吗？
Fine. Mark,right?

135
00:06:54,140 --> 00:06:56,140
哦……对，最好的朋友是这样叫的！
Yeah,yeah,that's what my close friends call me.

136
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,600
好，Carol，去哪温课？
So,Carol,where do you wanna study?

137
00:07:00,330 --> 00:07:03,900
哈哈，你找他原来是为了去温课！
Aha. That explains why you'd be over here seeing her.

138
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,520
去我的房间，
Well,how about my room?

139
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:07,700
这样就可以少一些愚蠢的干扰！
There'll be fewer stupid interruptions.

140
00:07:08,380 --> 00:07:09,340
你父母不介意？
Your parents won't mind?

141
00:07:09,980 --> 00:07:11,900
这就是咱们俩，
Well,we're the only ones here.

142
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,820
当然还有那个Mark！
Except for Mark,of course.

143
00:07:17,020 --> 00:07:20,240
波比我真搞不懂，罗密欧自杀前干嘛不对茱莉叶
Bobby,I don't know why Romeo didn't try CPR

144
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,880
好好检查一下。
on Juliet before he killed himself.

145
00:07:23,180 --> 00:07:25,300
他连脉搏也不搭一下
I mean,the guy doesn't even check the pulse,

146
00:07:25,300 --> 00:07:26,700
就把命赔上了！
before he does himself in.

147
00:07:27,060 --> 00:07:31,260
波比，要知道这是一出四百年前写的戏，
Bobby,the play is over four hundred years old.

148
00:07:31,540 --> 00:07:32,620
是古典作品。
It's a Classic.

149
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:34,520
听着，对你们天才来说，
Look! To you geniuses,

150
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:37,160
茱莉叶吃了从牧师那弄的药装死
it may make sense that Juliet gets some drug from a priest,

151
00:07:37,780 --> 00:07:38,910
也是有道理的。
and pretends like she's dead,

152
00:07:38,910 --> 00:07:40,480
以至于她可以和那个傻小子私奔，他连打电话
so that she can run off with a guy who's too stupid to pick up the phone

153
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,260
叫医生都不会
and call a doctor.

154
00:07:42,500 --> 00:07:45,290
可对我这号人，是种破玩意。
Well,to a guy like me,it's sheep dip!!

155
00:07:46,460 --> 00:07:49,280
你把莎士比亚的戏叫破玩意？
You're calling Shakespeare,"sheep dip"?

156
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:53,080
如果我是罗密欧，你是茱莉叶,
If I was Romeo,and you were Juliet

157
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:54,620
如果我这么爱你的话，
and I really had it bad for you,

158
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:56,620
不管是什么，也阻挡不了。
there's nothing nobody could say that would get in the way...

159
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:59,140
不管你的家庭，我的家庭，不管什么，
not my family,not your family,not nobody.

160
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:01,360
等大家明白过来你们早就开到
By the time those people turned around to look for you and me,

161
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:03,220
快到新泽西州了！
we'd be in my pick-up,half way to Jersey!!

162
00:08:07,990 --> 00:08:09,960
很抱歉我太冲动了。
I'm sorry I lost my temper.

163
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:13,060
有时我会被感情所左右，
Sometimes my emotions get the best of me.

164
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:16,210
甚至控制不了。
I guess I'm too sensitive.

165
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:21,580
这没关系。这东西我也不想要了。
It's OK. I really didn't want it anymore,anyway.

166
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:25,260
看来辅导也不能解决问题。
This tutoring stuff's a bad idea.

167
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:26,220
是我太笨了。
My head's too thick.

168
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,520
不不不不，
No,no,no,no,no.

169
00:08:28,100 --> 00:08:30,880
要知道理解莎士比亚是一件很难的事情。
Understanding Shakespeare is a very difficult thing to do.

170
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:33,980
我刚开始读的时候几个月也领悟不了，
You know,when I first read his plays I was lost for months;

171
00:08:34,710 --> 00:08:36,120
六年级一年我全耗上了。
it ruined my entire sixth grade year.

172
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:38,780
你六年级就念这玩意了？
You read this stuff in the sixth grade?

173
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:42,260
是怪人，对吗？
I'm weird,OK?

174
00:08:42,260 --> 00:08:43,780
不不不不，你很聪明。
No,no,no!! You're smart.

175
00:08:50,300 --> 00:08:53,780
天哪，为我浪费那么多时间你一定很没劲，对吗？
Boy,spending this much time with me must really be boring for you?

176
00:08:55,580 --> 00:08:56,620
那倒不是的。
Not really.

177
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:02,260
呃，读到哪了？
So where were we?

178
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,200
每个人都死了。
Everybody was dead.

179
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:08,700
晚饭有鱼吃，Ben，过半小时回来。
Dinner in half an hour Ben! Tuna Surpri

180
00:09:10,630 --> 00:09:13,320
啊！
Aargghh!!

181
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,180
孩子们！
Hey guys!

182
00:09:14,660 --> 00:09:17,660
HI，Mike，爸爸说你健康课得了个优？
Hey Mike. Dad told me about your A in health.

183
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:21,400
对。呵呵。你说说食物基本类别有哪四种？
Yeah. Come on Mike,let's hear those four basic food groups!

